  "details": "<p>Til-karme is an unlocated city in Gurgum. It has been suggested that it was located east of the Amanus Mountains, on the border with B\u012bt-Ag\u016bsi.</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "Til-karme is a city in Gurgum that is mentioned in an inscription of the Assyrian king Tiglath-pileser III (r. 744-727 BC).",
